A The title of the homework and the author names (you and your partner)

Project 4: gerp
Marcus Ho and Jakov Marohnic

B The purpose of the program

Recreate the unix grep command funcionality for parsing directories and 
files for instances of a specific word. It lets you serch for specific 
words in a provided directory using case sensitive or case insensitive 
search.

C Acknowledgements for any help you received, including references to 
